 "blocks": [
  {
   "block_id": "t6-01",
   "block_type": "HEADING",
   "text": "スコアではなく分母を",
   "attribution_mode": "NONE",
   "evidence_refs": []
  },
  {
   "block_id": "t6-02",
   "block_type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "text": "Googleの自律ウェットラボの構成要素（10月16日）は、分母の開示が読ませる。VERIDの意味双生児（照会可能な内省、時間圧縮シミュレーション、痕跡保持、安全実行、染料・水検証、フィードバックで5倍超の精度）は、16ページの技術報告で著者らが報告している内容だ。アプタマーのサンドボックス（27ページ）は、トロンビン0/167→54/208→131/311（42.1％、厳密な新規設計37.1％）、ミオグロビン20/196→9/244→184/549（33.5％）、G4崩壊75.0→19.1％からの回復72.4％。数字の並び自体が実験の履歴になっている。",
   "attribution_mode": "ATTRIBUTED",
   "evidence_refs": [
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:4c2680dd1e0eb52b",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-1",
     "subject_id": "wetlab-agents",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:4c2680dd1e0eb52b",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-2",
     "subject_id": "wetlab-agents",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:4c2680dd1e0eb52b",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-3",
     "subject_id": "wetlab-agents",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:4c2680dd1e0eb52b",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-4",
     "subject_id": "wetlab-agents",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "block_id": "t6-03",
   "block_type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "text": "エピトープ切除（17ページ）はHITLで5.06％から9.33％、GPU 42％削減。一方でMSA省略の倍加という人工物（収率の水増し注意報）、酵母ディスプレイのナノモル級結合、AlphaFold3のトークン割当量の記述が並ぶ。成功だけでなく人工物の開示があることが、この記事群の価値を支えている。安全面はFrontier Safetyと生体復元力、非感染試験、バイオスクリーニング、逐次・手順・実行の人間承認（HITL・生体安全の章）。単一標的（FAP）の人間・エージェント混成で発行者報告、という適用範囲の境界を守る。等式単位の監査は未実施である。",
   "attribution_mode": "ATTRIBUTED",
   "evidence_refs": [
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:4c2680dd1e0eb52b",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-1",
     "subject_id": "wetlab-agents",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:4c2680dd1e0eb52b",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-2",
     "subject_id": "wetlab-agents",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:4c2680dd1e0eb52b",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-3",
     "subject_id": "wetlab-agents",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:4c2680dd1e0eb52b",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-4",
     "subject_id": "wetlab-agents",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "block_id": "t6-04",
   "block_type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "text": "FAPの単一標的とナノモル級の結合、8.6倍という改善は、適用範囲の狭さと効果の具体性を同時に示す。非感染試験や人間承認とセットで安全の条件になる。",
   "attribution_mode": "ATTRIBUTED",
   "evidence_refs": [
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:4c2680dd1e0eb52b",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-1",
     "subject_id": "wetlab-agents",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:4c2680dd1e0eb52b",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-2",
     "subject_id": "wetlab-agents",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:4c2680dd1e0eb52b",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-3",
     "subject_id": "wetlab-agents",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:4c2680dd1e0eb52b",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-4",
     "subject_id": "wetlab-agents",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "block_id": "t6-05",
   "block_type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "text": "地球AIの地理空間推論エージェントは、評価設計の記事として読む。GRAの23技能・62道具、作業用データセット、事前計画と実行誘導（代理置換、行き止まり3回許容、最善努力）。GeoExpertQueries 101、GeoKTools 305、CBGB 45、UnivEARTH 140（飽和87〜94）。結果は専門家クエリ63（基線ほぼ不可）、GeoKTools 86対41、CBGB 80超対20未満。道具使用3→52、計画52→63の除去実験、FlashがPro以上で安価、失敗込みの費用、上限（呼び出し100回・30分・文脈100万トークン）と3反復。10月11日付の39ページの報告が示すのはこの設計であり、自動評価器対作業手順の初稿限界が明記され、分割・プロンプト・採点コードが公開（未実行）されている。",
   "attribution_mode": "ATTRIBUTED",
   "evidence_refs": [
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-1",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-2",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-3",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-4",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "block_id": "t6-06",
   "block_type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "text": "地球AIの評価設計は、四つの条件設定と二つのモデルの比較で読む。素体・基本道具つき・GRA技能道具つき・完全GRAを、Gemini 3.1 Proと3.8 Flashの両方で比べ、各条件3反復の平均とばらつきで測っている。GeoExpertQueriesではFlashが52.2±5.4から62.7±2.5へ10.5ポイント伸ばしたのに対し、Proは50.8±1.7から47.6±2.7へ3.2ポイント下げた。道具の有無が両モデルで大きく効く一方、計画と実行誘導の上乗せはモデル依存であり、普遍の改善ではない。",
   "attribution_mode": "ATTRIBUTED",
   "evidence_refs": [
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-1",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-2",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-3",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-4",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "block_id": "t6-22",
   "block_type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "text": "測定の手続きも読む。各条件3反復の平均とばらつきで測り、失敗した実行も費用に含める。呼び出し100回・30分・文脈100万トークンという上限が、分母の条件だ。失敗込みの費用（Flashで0.199ドル対0.167ドル）が、計画の3セントの意味になる。",
   "attribution_mode": "ATTRIBUTED",
   "evidence_refs": [
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-1",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-2",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-3",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-4",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "block_id": "t6-07",
   "block_type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "text": "道具と計画の寄与は別々に測られている。技能と道具だけで3から52へ、計画と実行誘導で52から63という内訳だ。検索7.0回から3.2回へ、Earth Engine利用54対38％という振る舞いの変化も添えられている。内訳があるから、どこが効いたかが分かる。",
   "attribution_mode": "ATTRIBUTED",
   "evidence_refs": [
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-1",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-2",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-3",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-4",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "block_id": "t6-08",
   "block_type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "text": "統制された比較でも同じ構図だ。GeoKToolsではProが84.5±1.4から81.6±1.4へわずかに下げ、Flash側の86対41という伸びとは対照的だ。外部ベンチマークのCBGB（専門家が作った45問の外部検証用セット）では80超対20未満と、Flashの完全GRAが明確に抜けている。計画の寄与は、開かれた問いではモデルによって正にも負にも振れる。",
   "attribution_mode": "ATTRIBUTED",
   "evidence_refs": [
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-1",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-2",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-3",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-4",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "block_id": "t6-23",
   "block_type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "text": "道具と計画の分解も読む。探索7.0から3.2回、地球引擎利用38から54％、Flashの0.167から0.199ドル（約3セントで10.5点）、Proの0.512から0.688ドル、FlashはProの3分の1以下で上回る。単答 benchmarksに計画上乗せはなく、UnivEARTHは飽和（86.9/93.6、既刊文面で解答可）と記す。道具が主、計画は開放型のみというのが報告の結論だ。",
   "attribution_mode": "ATTRIBUTED",
   "evidence_refs": [
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-1",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-2",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-3",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-4",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "block_id": "t6-10",
   "block_type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "text": "基準作業手順の作り方は検証されている。3名の専門家が道具を知らずに独立に作り、4件の不整合は捨てずに残した。採点器自体も人間が検証した道具非依存の方式であり、開発分割25/76と85/220、採点コードまで公開されている。不一致を残す判断が、評価の誠実さの証拠になる。",
   "attribution_mode": "ATTRIBUTED",
   "evidence_refs": [
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-1",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-2",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-3",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    },
    {
     "evidence_task_id": "evidence:2026-W42:083133eb0e891661",
     "kind": "CLAIM",
     "evidence_id": "claim-4",
     "subject_id": "earth-ai-gra",
     "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "block_id": "t6-11",
   "block_type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "text": "飽和の警告も読みどころだ。UnivEARTHは素体でも87〜94と飽和し、公開文からの回答で分析なしに解ける。飽和した指標で優劣を語らないことが、評価の規律だ。開発分割と採点コードの公開範囲は、検証可能性を担保している。",
   "attribution_mode": "ATTRIBUTED",
